# RouteRoom 3D does not require any environment variables to run.
#
# The demo uses local, synthetic city-pack data (src/lib/city-packs/) and
# has no server-side API keys, no database, and no third-party routing,
# geocoding, or map-tile service. `npm run dev`, `npm run build`, and the
# deployed app all work with zero configuration.
#
# If you add a real API integration later (routing, geocoding, weather),
# put its keys in a real `.env.local` file (already gitignored) and
# document the variable name here as a comment only. Never commit an
# actual key, and never put one in a WebMCP tool's input or output schema.
